00:03:53.948 --> 00:03:56.539
<v Vocab>研究者

00:03:56.939 --> 00:03:58.692
<v Host>It means researcher.

00:03:59.292 --> 00:04:10.068
<v Slow>宮本さんは、1977年に大学を卒業して、任天堂に入りました。

00:04:10.867 --> 00:04:16.435
<v Host>Miyamoto graduated from college in nineteen seventy-seven and joined Nintendo.

00:04:17.036 --> 00:04:19.555
