00:04:52.196 --> 00:04:54.067
<v Host>It means popular.

00:04:54.668 --> 00:05:01.339
<v Slow>最近は、テーマパークや映画の仕事もしています。

00:05:02.139 --> 00:05:05.908
<v Host>Recently, he also works on theme parks and movies.

